#: ../../../librarymanager/creating.rst:96
msgid "Publishing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../librarymanager/creating.rst:98
msgid ""
"You can publish a library to the `PlatformIO Registry <https://platformio."
"org/lib>`__ using :ref:`cmd_pkg_publish` command. Every time when you modify "
"a source code of a library you will need to increment the \"version\" field "
"in :ref:`library_json` manifest and re-publish again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../librarymanager/creating.rst:103
msgid ""
"If the published library has an issue and you would like to remove it from "
"the PlatformIO Registry, please use :ref:`cmd_pkg_unpublish` command."
msgstr ""

